Z||000001||isthiswhereiputausername?||06-25-2001||05:05 PM||||thats my speciality   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>what version of psx?<P><BR>Does it have a modchip?  <BR>A chip wire may have busted loose.  Were you trying to play a burnt or real cdrom?  <BR>Also try an audio cd to see if you get the menu playing.<P>You may need to adjust the laser.. a sudden jolt may knock it off adjustment..<P>When the lasers are aligned wrong , they will keep trying to spin and stop..etc<P><BR>heres a quick idea how to do it..<P>TAKE IT APART CAREFULLY..<BR> <A HREF="http://www.psxtune.com/adjust.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.psxtune.com/adjust.html</A> <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by isthiswhereiputausername? (edited 06-25-2001).]||||reg||1
